  "_about": "Build 2026-11-24a (test 60's fixes and the tester's wishes after it, on top of 2026-11-23b; eight units merged): the rider held still at a getting off (ParkStop, ParkHold), the parked bike re-placed after its enable and its collision checked (ParkSolid), the lean in the room box, the stand's foot, the fallback search, the guard's unmoving someone, the swim's spot; every stimpak's heal kept (UseItemFirst), the seat pose through a use clip (UseSeatHold), the first-person arms hidden through one (BodyArmsUse); the first-person look turning the aim (LookAim); the first-person left arm's node-less bones (BodyGunGripNodeless); the third-person orbit with a weapon (LookOrbitArmed, shipped at 0); the log's smaller fixes and the scripts' (KitQuickExit, EquipLate, LandOnce, APWatch 0). Packaged on 2026-11-10a's package as the asset base with 2026-11-23b's fifteen overlays, unchanged, in the same order (OVERLAY=<1>:<2>:...:<15>, the later winning): /opt/cmb/assets15b/Data, /opt/cmb/assets16a/a/Data, /opt/cmb/assets16a/b/Data, /opt/cmb/assets16a/c/Data, /opt/cmb/assets17a/badges/Data, /opt/cmb/assets17a/plates/Data, /opt/cmb/assets21a/shells/Data, /opt/cmb/assets21a/wear/Data, /opt/cmb/assets21a/art2d/Data, /opt/cmb/assets22a/shells/Data, /opt/cmb/assets22a/wear/Data, /opt/cmb/assets22a/art2d/Data, /opt/cmb/assets22a/parked/Data, /opt/cmb/assets23a/wear/Data, /opt/cmb/assets23a/art2d/Data. Keys starting with _ are comments. What differs from the 2026-11-23b package, in two kinds: (1) the commit's own shipped files, checked against the commit by the tracked-files check and never listed in vs_previous: Data/Scripts/Source/User/CMB_ControllerScript.psc and CMB_HotkeyF4SE.psc, Data/F4SE/Plugins/CMB_Slope.ini, and Data/F4SE/Plugins/CMB_Slope.dll once the build's DLL is committed (git diff --stat bca9231 <the build's commit> -- Data lists them); the ESP and the MCM folder are 2026-11-23b's byte for byte; (2) the compiled scripts and assets, below (vs_previous): no asset,